      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Use the [`element`](xcuielementquery/element.md) property to access a query’s result when you expect a single matching element for the query, but want to check for multiple ambiguous matches before accessing the result.",
      "normalizedSource": "Use the [`element`](xcuielementquery/element.md) property to access a query’s result when you expect a single matching element for the query, but want to check for multiple ambiguous matches before accessing the result.",
      "sourceHash": "4468efa7107be6a70ad7bb34e50cdd7dd5a5acb6f2ec3489963d389705332cce",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "The [`element`](xcuielementquery/element.md) property traverses your app’s accessibility tree to check for multiple matching elements before returning, and fails the current test if there isn’t a single matching element.",
