      "normalizedSource": "In cases where you know categorically that there’s a single matching element, use the [`XCUIElementTypeQueryProvider`](xcuielementtypequeryprovider.md) [`firstMatch`](xcuielementtypequeryprovider/firstmatch.md) property instead.",
